On 9 May 2006 17:24:09 -0700, Ville Saalo wrote:

>A wizmode testing suggests that Demogorgon cannot be cancelled.
>However, your other points are valid. In addition to those, I have used
>wands of cancellation to cancel rust monsters and disenchanters.
